        "id": 129152,
        "authorName": "ژوبین محمد هوشیار",
        "authorUrl": null,
        "commentDate": "2025-03-15T04:10:28.9951865",
        "htmlComment": "<p>This ghazal is about the awakening of the Soul from the sleep of the apparent materiality.</p>\r\n<p>To awken the Soul, Friend breaks the heart of His devotee. When the heart breaks, a Light enters into it that is shed by the Unseen Sun</p>\r\n<p>The Soul then Remembers the Day of Alast and soars Home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>با پر بلی بلند می&zwnj;پر</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>چون محرم گلشن الستی</p>\r\n<p>This is in reference to Al-Qur'an Majeed's Sura 7 Sign 172.</p>\r\n<p>\"Remember\"</p>\r\n<p>\"Am I not your Lord?\"</p>\r\n<p>\"Yes!\"</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
